---
import { Card, CardGrid } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
---

<section class="py-16">
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <CardGrid stagger>
    <Card title="Cross-platform" icon="pencil">
      Works on macOS and Linux, using the system’s default audio player.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Quick setup" icon="add-document">
      Install with a single command.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Simple configuration" icon="setting">
      Centralised configuration with easily customisable audio.
    </Card>
    <Card title="Get started" icon="open-book">
      Read the <a href="/intro">introduction</a>.
    </Card>
  </CardGrid>
</section>
